    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This collection includes four parts\uff1a </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1, Commando 2</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059010/extras/b5eb8e935d0e6b5089a2a98426829c53.avif?t=1750666882\" width=146 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has been fully optimized in this compilation, featuring new enemies, enriched level design, a new Workshop system, high-definition visuals, balanced difficulty, and adjusted AI for some bosses. Additionally, many interesting sound effects have been added, making the gameplay experience more immersive for players. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059010/extras/aa07d1ad4fc143f54f0bf217769c3378.poster.avif?t=1750666882\" width=590 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059010/extras/aa07d1ad4fc143f54f0bf217769c3378.webm?t=1750666882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059010/extras/aa07d1ad4fc143f54f0bf217769c3378.mp4?t=1750666882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After entering the game, you can find a wealth of customizable options in the settings screen in the upper left corner, such as enemy generation multiplier, boss summoning troops and blood effect personalization. Through these settings, you will experience a different kind of gameplay from your childhood, and you will be able to face the tidal wave of enemies and feel the extreme pleasure of sweeping away thousands of troops!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059010/extras/05f69a5c668a225db88152ac17eb8b27.poster.avif?t=1750666882\" width=590 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059010/extras/05f69a5c668a225db88152ac17eb8b27.webm?t=1750666882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059010/extras/05f69a5c668a225db88152ac17eb8b27.mp4?t=1750666882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2, Commando X Allied Assault </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059010/extras/6e43fda8e64ff0f4da9e62f0886a8930.avif?t=1750666882\" width=146 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an offshoot of Commando 2, players in this game will engage in positional confrontation with enemy forces, experiencing a completely different group combat mode from that of Generation 2. As with &quot;Commando 2&quot;, this work has also been fully optimized to bring a better gaming experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3, Commando 3</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059010/extras/b4bb1840473e9432d4d64ced06dc8b5b.avif?t=1750666882\" width=146 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a sequel to Commando 2, this game adds a rich mount system, more enemy types and battle scenes, while the game's painting style has changed from a Q version to a more realistic style, bringing players a more realistic war experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4, Special Gift Section</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059010/extras/8e902f0ea4525cb7e7491e14354f3f0d.avif?t=1750666882\" width=146 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This section contains a small music video for Commando 2, scanned designs, a curtain call animation for the entire cast, and an introduction to the series' future plans. This special content provides players with even more to enjoy and look forward to outside of the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a veteran or a newcomer to the series, Commando Collection will bring you unprecedentedly intense battles and a rich gaming experience. Get ready to step onto the battlefields of World War II and experience the passion of combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some key visuals and promotional illustrations for this game were generated using AI tools based on original characters from the game, and are intended for promotional use only.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This collection includes four parts\uff1a </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1, Commando 2</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059010/extras/b5eb8e935d0e6b5089a2a98426829c53.avif?t=1750666882\" width=146 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has been fully optimized in this compilation, featuring new enemies, enriched level design, a new Workshop system, high-definition visuals, balanced difficulty, and adjusted AI for some bosses. Additionally, many interesting sound effects have been added, making the gameplay experience more immersive for players. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059010/extras/aa07d1ad4fc143f54f0bf217769c3378.poster.avif?t=1750666882\" width=590 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059010/extras/aa07d1ad4fc143f54f0bf217769c3378.webm?t=1750666882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059010/extras/aa07d1ad4fc143f54f0bf217769c3378.mp4?t=1750666882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After entering the game, you can find a wealth of customizable options in the settings screen in the upper left corner, such as enemy generation multiplier, boss summoning troops and blood effect personalization. Through these settings, you will experience a different kind of gameplay from your childhood, and you will be able to face the tidal wave of enemies and feel the extreme pleasure of sweeping away thousands of troops!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059010/extras/05f69a5c668a225db88152ac17eb8b27.poster.avif?t=1750666882\" width=590 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059010/extras/05f69a5c668a225db88152ac17eb8b27.webm?t=1750666882\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059010/extras/05f69a5c668a225db88152ac17eb8b27.mp4?t=1750666882\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2, Commando X Allied Assault </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059010/extras/6e43fda8e64ff0f4da9e62f0886a8930.avif?t=1750666882\" width=146 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As an offshoot of Commando 2, players in this game will engage in positional confrontation with enemy forces, experiencing a completely different group combat mode from that of Generation 2. As with &quot;Commando 2&quot;, this work has also been fully optimized to bring a better gaming experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3, Commando 3</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059010/extras/b4bb1840473e9432d4d64ced06dc8b5b.avif?t=1750666882\" width=146 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a sequel to Commando 2, this game adds a rich mount system, more enemy types and battle scenes, while the game's painting style has changed from a Q version to a more realistic style, bringing players a more realistic war experience. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4, Special Gift Section</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3059010/extras/8e902f0ea4525cb7e7491e14354f3f0d.avif?t=1750666882\" width=146 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This section contains a small music video for Commando 2, scanned designs, a curtain call animation for the entire cast, and an introduction to the series' future plans. This special content provides players with even more to enjoy and look forward to outside of the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a veteran or a newcomer to the series, Commando Collection will bring you unprecedentedly intense battles and a rich gaming experience. Get ready to step onto the battlefields of World War II and experience the passion of combat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some key visuals and promotional illustrations for this game were generated using AI tools based on original characters from the game, and are intended for promotional use only.</p>",
    "short_description": "A reboot of classic 2D side-scrolling shooters, featuring a new Survival Mode and Workshop system. Fight as a WWII Allied soldier across diverse battlefields with imaginative weapons. Survival Mode brings fresh enemies, epic bosses, and new challenges\u2014relive childhood memories with a twist!",
